    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "a shallow angle... and aimed at the heart? it sounds so... surgical. but i'm so afraid of the sensation, of pulling back at the last second and only making it worse. if i'm going to follow this traditional way you mentioned, do i just... thrust? or is there a different way to handle the weight of the blade to make sure it doesn't slip?",
